# Keep the build context small and prevent host build output from leaking into
# the image (which would also invalidate the restore layer on every build).
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.git/
**/.github/
**/TestResults/
**/coverage*
**/node_modules/

Tests/
NexusHome.Web/
NexusHome.WebApp/
NexusHome.DeviceSimulator/

**/*.user
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/logs/
*.log

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml
*.md

# Local worktrees and persistent runtime data are not image inputs
.claude/
data/
uploads/
certificates/
